Subject: [PATCH 429/572] fix(st-clock): do not include platform_def.h

There is no need to include platform_def.h in stm32mp2_clk.h. However
we'll need stdint.h for some int types.
This was found by Coverity: Defect (PW.INCLUDE_RECURSION)

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git 855bf2b2a2b60f9bfaf2243555710c4f5a1d2a0d fix(st-clock): do not include platform_def.h]
